<h3 class=3D"lightfont mb-4 claranet-font-5">What=E2=80=99s the real impact=
 of training your team through NotSoSecure?</h3>
<p>Harden your perimeter, lower the risk of compromise, and make your organ=
isation a less attractive target for attackers by building a team that can =
